{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年68歲的老戲骨李成昌演出逾180部作品，近年因在多部劇集中演出奸角獲封「奸人」專業戶，更因效忠TVB近半世紀，三度被挖角不動搖，獲封「TVB忠臣」。李成昌活到老演到老，去年宣布續約兩年兼加人工，獲得150個騷，更有份入新劇《璀璨之城》，監製勒令留期不讓他拍其他戲，相當搶手。李成昌日前分享開工照片，大曬劇組好人緣。</p><figure><img alt=\"李成昌去年宣布續約兩年兼加人工。（抖音）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250421/991071360925175808603274.png/0oSJ0usOgtIyzbnEwJLF8Egdjso9k1BvUygsxVMoLMU\"/><figcaption>李成昌去年宣布續約兩年兼加人工。（抖音）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李成昌爆監製不讓他拍其他戲。（小紅書）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260105/1084891363578744832903716.png/bryZCPOG-n_0oY0N5qHHGFq6u9lae8ItQQajBUEGowU\"/><figcaption>李成昌爆監製不讓他拍其他戲。（小紅書）</figcaption></figure><p>李成昌開工曬劇組好人緣</p><p>李成昌日前在社交平台分享開工照片，他發文：「休息!工作再工作!」看來平時忙於行山之餘，也不忘努力工作。李成昌開心地比起手指公，穿上戲中服飾自拍，有工開非常興奮。李成昌狂與現場演員打卡，有陳煒、徐榮、陳少邦等人。李成昌年近70仍然精神爽利，相信同平時做開運動有關係。李成昌去年曾受訪指不介意做到74歲供留英女兒讀心理學碩士學位，實在是「廿四孝爸爸」。</p><figure><img alt=\"李成昌勁曬劇組好人緣。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131783070388224308254.png/QBYoEq8EaeE2k3YKzW-Af0rlFPnZRsL3IUa5JCFGuSQ\"/><figcaption>李成昌勁曬劇組好人緣。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李成昌勁曬劇組好人緣。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131799231565824387290.png/bcqoTSJOaEVQqf0HzguhKGL2LpTX74GrO_ActDvwHLQ\"/><figcaption>李成昌勁曬劇組好人緣。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"年近70仍密密開工。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131796123455488902718.png/7qU5MX5NqbVhm8ylTvFyYj25py1EZreMi0DycotA8nI\"/><figcaption>年近70仍密密開工。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"年近70仍密密開工。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131793501884416374815.png/BwfiSozhJISrPsounkJwBITMbGu2RdWkufwPgrn8D4I\"/><figcaption>年近70仍密密開工。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"供留英女兒讀碩士。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131791324909568452861.png/qHAQnUQzHU-3pbaztNlnlVkx1Q5kqeDYSIXaO0iF2js\"/><figcaption>供留英女兒讀碩士。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"供留英女兒讀碩士。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131788841750528859342.png/Quq-7FMejYEbex0R81okwuF8jyTfZ03F7VwXQ-1cF0M\"/><figcaption>供留英女兒讀碩士。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開工！（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131796480102400658327.png/TTjaDnkEGlm4-dwdNUTFez3bC9w3_nlnO3KUIDtylCA\"/><figcaption>開工！（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"開工！（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131794265378816432768.png/zIFMYRJiPIHWnOlK-hk0vD6ifocVrDxoPsGzTj7Bs04\"/><figcaption>開工！（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"精神。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131791983546368507824.png/u4xwVzX9eue42esZxA8jFnRjjZ79ZoQfTtwbJE7cGyQ\"/><figcaption>精神。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"精神。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131789609439232529746.png/AW-Uj4e7icMajvEOQyQVthKADlCzncJZ8eTcD_Hk3A8\"/><figcaption>精神。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李成昌愛分享日常。（小紅書@李成昌）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260726/1158131787348578304543916.png/4LiuS8U6PVce6pbFg9bChzf9wighrZv_JiSerCYknqw\"/><figcaption>李成昌愛分享日常。（小紅書@李成昌）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T15:34:31.589834+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":578,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}